---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---
<SiteLayout page="about">
<main>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row"></div>
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col s12">
                    <ul class="tabs">
                        <li class="tab col s3"><a class="active" href="#quickinfo">Quick Info</a></li>
                        <li class="tab col s3"><a href="#schedule">Schedule</a></li>
                        <li class="tab col s3"><a href="#location">Location</a></li>
                        <li class="tab col s3"><a href="#rules">Rules</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="quickinfo" class="col s12">
            <div class="container">
                <h4>Quick Information</h4>
                
                <blockquote>
                    The 14th annual JHMMC took place on October 11-12, 2025. Thank you to all participants! Information below is for reference about the 2025 competition.
                </blockquote>
                <p>The contest was held <i>in person</i> across two days separated by grade.</p>
                <table class="highlight">
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="name">Dates:</td>
                            <td>The competition was held on Saturday, October 11, 2025 for 6th graders and below; Sunday, October 12, 2025 for 7th-8th graders.</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="name">Time:</td>
                            <td>8:30 AM to 2:00 PM</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td class="name">Eligibility:</td>
                            <td>The competition was open to students from the
                                4th to 8th grades. Those in 3rd grade and
                                below could register as 4th
                                grade. Students could only take one contest,
                                that for their own grade level. Students who participated on Saturday could not participate again on Sunday.
                            </td>
                        </tr>

                        <tr>
                            <td class="name">Registration:</td>
                            <td>
                                Registration for the 2025 competition has closed. The competition took place on October 11-12, 2025.<br><br>

                                Online and on-site registration were available for both days of the competition. 
                                The participation fee was $40 for online registration and $50 for walk-in registration (cash only).
                                <br><br>
                                Please check back in fall 2026 for information about the 2026 competition.
                            </td>
                        </tr>

                        <tr>
                            <td class="name">Results:</td>
                            <td> Results were compiled, with top-scoring
                                participants announced the day-of at the
                                award ceremony. Complete results and all test materials 
                                are now available on the <a href="/archive.html">Archive page</a>.
                            </td>
                        </tr>


                        <tr>
                            <td class="name">Contact:</td>
                            <td>For any questions or concerns,
                                please reach out to Mr. Pinyan at
                                <a href="mailto:jonpin@bergen.org">jonpin@bergen.org</a>.
                                You can also visit <a href="https://bcamathteam.org">the BCA Math Team website</a> for more information.
                            </td>
                        </tr>

                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
            <br>
            <br>
            <br>
            <br>
            
        </div>

        <div id="schedule" class="col s12">
            <div class="container">
                <h4>Schedule</h4>
                <p>
                    The schedule for each day of the 2025 competition was:
                    <ul>
                        <li>8:30 - Check-in began, auditorium lobby.</li>
                        <li>9:30 - All contestants arrived by this time. Opening remarks and instructions.</li>
                        <li>10:00 - Contestants brought to testing rooms, competition began</li>
                        <li>11:30 - Pizza lunch served to contestants in testing rooms</li>
                        <li>12:00 - Students returned to gymnasium. Keynote address and/or activities.</li>
                        <li>1:30 - Award ceremony in gymnasium.</li>
                    </ul>
                    The award ceremony ended around 2:00pm.
                </p>
            </div>
            <br>
            <br>
            <br>
            <br>
        </div>
        <div id="location" class="col s12">
            <div class="container">
                <h4>Location</h4>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col s12 m10 offset-m1">
                        <div class="card grey lighten-4">
                            <div class="card-image">
                                <img src="/images/bca_front_view.jpg" style="filter: brightness(70%);"
                                    alt="Bergen County Academies">
                                <span class="card-title">Bergen County
                                    Academies</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="card-content">
                                <p>200 Hackensack Avenue</p>
                                <p>Hackensack, New Jersey 07601</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="card-action">
                                <a onclick="$('#map-modal').modal('open');" style="cursor: pointer;" class="waves-effect waves-light btn teal
                                        lighten-2">View google
                                    maps</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div id="map-modal" class="modal">
                    <div class="modal-content">
                        <div class="map-responsive">
                            <iframe
                                src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3015.63862236354!2d-74.03578188380395!3d40.901741379311765!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x89c2fa74ede555a7%3A0xf25cd69861dd5ef7!2s200+Hackensack+Ave%2C+Hackensack%2C+NJ+07601!5e0!3m2!1sen!2sus!4v1566338187462!5m2!1sen!2sus"
                                width="600" height="450" title="Map to Bergen County Academies" style="border:0" allowfullscreen></iframe>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="modal-footer">
                        <a href="#!" class="modal-close btn-flat">Close</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div id="rules" class="col s12">
            <div class="container">
                <h4>Rules</h4>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col s12">
                        <ul class="collection with-header">
                            <li class="collection-header">
                                <h4>General Rules</h4>
                            </li>
                            <li class="collection-item">Calculators are not
                                allowed.</li>
                            <li class="collection-item">This is an
                                individual test, so you may not communicate
                                with
                                anyone else
                                taking it.</li>
                            <li class="collection-item">Once time begins, we
                                will not answer any questions about the
                                problems.
                            </li>
                            <li class="collection-item">You will have 75
                                minutes to solve 40 problems. Once time is
                                called, you
                                must put down your pen or pencil and stop
                                working.</li>
                            <li class="collection-item">Scores will be
                                posted on the website. Your score will
                                appear
                                next to
                                your identification number.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col s12">
                        <ul class="collection with-header">
                            <li class="collection-header">
                                <h5>Specifics</h5>
                            </li>
                            <li class="collection-item">You have a test
                                paper, answer sheet, and scrap paper.</li>
                            <li class="collection-item">You may use space on
                                your test paper and additional scrap paper
                                to do
                                work. Your answers must be written on the
                                answer sheet. We will not look at answers
                                written on
                                your test paper.</li>
                            <li class="collection-item">Each problem has
                                only one answer. If you put more than one
                                answer for a
                                problem, you will be marked wrong. When
                                changing an answer, be sure to erase or
                                cross
                                out
                                completely.</li>
                            <li class="collection-item">Write legibly. If
                                the graders cannot read your answer, it will
                                be marked
                                incorrect.</li>
                            <li class="collection-item">Do not approximate
                                constants unless a problem specifies you should.</li>
                            <li class="collection-item">If a unit is
                                indicated in the problem, the answer must be
                                given
                                in that
                                unit. For instance, if the problem asks for
                                the answer in hours, you cannot give your
                                answer in
                                minutes. Furthermore, you don't need to
                                write the unit, as the graders will assume
                                your
                                answer
                                is in the units asked for in the problem.</li>
                            <li class="collection-item">There is no penalty
                                for guessing.</li>
                            <li class="collection-item">Ties will be broken
                                based on the number of correct responses to
                                the last
                                ten questions. If a tie remains, then the
                                correct responses to the last five questions
                                will
                                break the tie.</li>
                            <li class="collection-item">We will announce how
                                much time is remaining often during the
                                test.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>

    </main>
</SiteLayout>
